              "count": 1,
              "items": [
                {
                  "id": "",
                  "status": "",
                  "title": "compliance: S03 is assessed clause by clause against the SPEC §8 S3 gate and the slice plan §7 gate. The four gate properties are carried by named tests: board.rs::archived_implies_the_card_sits_in_an_archive_list and ::restore_off_a_non_archive_list_is_an_error (a), claim_race.rs::thirty_two_racers_get_exactly_one_grant_and_the_fence_is_monotonic (b), approval_race.rs::sixteen_racers_create_exactly_one_pending_approval (c), transitions.rs::a_terminal_run_rejects_every_transition_and_a_revision_is_dense (d). Tenant isolation is rls_domain.rs::the_fourteen_domain_tables_isolate_runtime_owner_and_superuser. The schema-review clause is met with two admitted packages: v1-s03-1 (P1) records that property (b)'s lease-exclusivity half is not exercised, and v1-s03-2 (P2) records that the archive-exclusion claim covers only the two board-scan indexes. The Phase-G review records the compliance level against this contract; the rework's acceptance instrument is acceptance/programme/S03.toml, and the closure gate is decided by an approver other than its requester on the P0-only gate."
                }
              ],
