                  "id": "",
                  "status": "",
                  "title": "compliance: Compliance is assessed by the Phase-G compliance review recorded against this contract: exactly one of the standard's six levels — irrelevant, consistent, compliant, conformant, fully_conformant, non_conformant — with its findings and evidence references. The evidence is the acceptance manifest's verdict (`acceptance/programme/SPEC-V2.toml`), the published closure outputs (`evidence`, `closure-review`) and the accepted WBS deliverable. A deviation is rejected, mitigated, or accepted for a defined period through a waiver naming the accepting asset owner, the reason, the additional cost and risk, and the reassessment date; this delivery carries no waiver. The review is retrospective: the project was closed 2026-11-17 with no compliance review at all."
